usage: main.py [-h] [--version] [--cores-root CORES_ROOT] [--config CONFIG]
               [--monochrome] [--verbose] [--log-file LOG_FILE]
               {fetch,core,tool,list-cores,core-info,gen,list-paths,library,run,config}
               ...

positional arguments:
  {fetch,core,tool,list-cores,core-info,gen,list-paths,library,run,config}
    fetch               Fetch a remote core and its dependencies to local
                        cache
    core                Subcommands for dealing with cores
    tool                Subcommands for dealing with tools
    list-cores          List available cores
    core-info           Display details about a core
    gen                 Run or show information about generators
    list-paths          Display the search order for core root paths
    library             Subcommands for dealing with library management
    run                 Start a tool flow
    config              Read/write config default section [main]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             Display the FuseSoC version
  --cores-root CORES_ROOT
                        Add additional directories containing cores
  --config CONFIG       Specify the config file to use
  --monochrome          Don't use color for messages
  --verbose             More info messages
  --log-file LOG_FILE   Write log messages to file
